  (text "BLE: Raytac MDBT50Q-1MV2 (nRF52840, chip antenna) used only as an untrusted serial transport.\nChosen over the nRF54L15 module of the Phase 1 proposal because its symbol and footprint are in the reviewed KiCad library.\nRail +3V3_BLE is switched by the MCU. Firmware must drive the UART and reset lines low or high-Z while the rail is off.\nUART pins are arbitrary nRF GPIOs (set in the module firmware). VDD and VDDH tied (normal-voltage mode), USB and DC/DC pins unused.\nJ5 programs the module. Keep copper and components out of the antenna keep-out in the Raytac layout guide."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8)
      )
      (justify left top)
    )
    (uuid f43396ea-324d-5ad1-837c-0300d16265f2)
  )
